  "description": "Upgrade your Dodge Ram 1500 Crew Cab New Body with OEDRO Running Boards, designed for both rugged durability and sleek style. Featuring a drop-down side step design, these nerf bars make getting in and out of your truck easier and safer. Built with a heavy-duty square tube structure and finished with dual-stage textured black powder coating, they offer excellent rust and corrosion resistance while adding aggressive, off-road-ready looks. With a quick, no-drill installation, OEDRO step rails deliver the perfect blend of functionality, protection, and bold appearance for your truck.\nFeatures\nPerfect Fitment: Custom-designed for 2019-2026 Dodge Ram 1500 New Body Crew Cab, ensuring a sleek, factory-style appearance.\nHeavy-Duty Strength: Built from carbon steel with a reinforced square tube structure, each side supports up to 450 lbs.\nSafe & Comfortable Access : 4.7-inch drop step with a 4-inch wide, non-slip surface for easier and safer entry in all conditions.\nCorrosion & Weather Resistant : Dual-stage e-coating protects against rust, corrosion, and harsh weather environments.\nQuick Bolt-On Installation: No drilling required; includes all mounting hardware for a fast, DIY install quickly.\n1-Year Warranty & Professional Installation Recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2019-2026 Dodge Ram 1500 New Body Crew Cab.",
